    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the unhinged, meme-fueled chaos of Bombardiro Crocodilo: Italian Brainrot Simulator, where the viral Italian Brainrot universe explodes into a wild action-adventure game! Join Bombardiro Crocodilo, the iconic crocodile-bomber plane, and a roster of absurd\u00a0 meme characters like Bombombini Gusini, Tralalero Tralala, and Lirili Larila in a surreal battle for supremacy across the Croco Nation and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tralalero Tralala</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tun tun tun tun sahur</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bombardiro Crocodilo: Control the airplane and fight against Lirili Larila</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Brr Brr Patapim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter game mode: Hunt down all brainrot characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First and third person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very deep plot written by Thomas Bernstein Jr</p></li></ul>",
